        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ann Beattie, Edgar Rice Burroughs\n- Works: Chilly Scenes of Winter\n- Companies: Doubleday\n- Roles: novelist, short story writer, fiction writer\n- Topics: adventure fiction, science fiction\n\nFacts:\n- Edgar Rice Burroughs was born on September 1, 1875, and he became an American fiction writer known for prolific adventure and science-fiction writing.\n- Ann Beattie was born on September 8, 1947, and she is an American novelist and short story writer.\n- Chilly Scenes of Winter is Ann Beattie’s first novel, and Doubleday published it in September 1976.\n- Edgar Rice Burroughs died on March 19, 1950.",
